is to trial  and to show that she could be held  accountable for this heinous heinous  scheme  so how do you feel speaking  how do you feel speaking in court  it actually felt very powerful to  finally have a chance to speak and and  you know have my voice on the record uh  and say the things that i wanted to say  about how her crimes had impacted the  people impacted myself and the people  that that i know and care about  honey how did you feel listening to her  in court uh just i'll just say one more  thing that yeah her her statement felt  like a very hollow apology to me she did  not take responsibility for the crimes  that she committed and it felt like once  more her trying to do something to  benefit her  and not at all about the harm that she  had caused
 

